    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">HMO102 · Chapter 14 · Session 52</span>\n<h2>Session 52 — Chapter 13: Special Events (cont)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13204 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">HMO102 · Chương 14 · Buổi 52</span>\n<h2>Buổi 52 — Chapter 13: Special Events (cont)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13204 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Chapter 13: Special Events (cont)<br><br>- Required Skills and Abilities for Event Management</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Textbook, Slides</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Read powerpoint slides and textbook before lecture</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CT1</strong> — Define the process of negotiation.</li>\n<li><strong>CT2</strong> — What do the skills and abilities need for successful event management?</li>\n<li><strong>HCM1</strong> — Define the process of negotiation.</li>\n<li><strong>HCM2</strong> — What do the skills and abilities need for successful event management?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
